{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_43311","headline":"人不易知 · 郑昉","name":"人不易知","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"如面诚非一，深心岂易知。\n入秦书十上，投楚岁三移。\n和玉翻爲泣，齐竽或滥吹。\n周行虽有寘，殷鉴在前规。\n寅亮推多士，清通固赏奇。\n病诸方号哲，敢相反成疵。\n冬日承余爱，霜云喜暂披。\n无令见瞻後，回照复云疲。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"郑昉","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_43311.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_43311","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}